.TH MERMAN-CLI-COMPLETION 1 2026-08-15 "Merman 0.8.0-alpha.6" "Merman CLI Manual"
.SH NAME
merman\-cli\-completion \- Generate shell completion scripts
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBmerman\-cli completion\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] <\fISHELL\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Generate shell completion scripts
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.TP
<\fISHELL\fR>
Shell to generate completions for
.sp
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
bash
.IP \(bu 2
elvish
.IP \(bu 2
fish
.IP \(bu 2
powershell
.IP \(bu 2
zsh
.RE
.SH EXTRA
Examples:
  merman\-cli completion bash
  merman\-cli completion zsh
.SH VERSION
v0.8.0\-alpha.6
